<title>EDLC — Excavation & Design Co | Earthworks, Exposed Concrete & Exterior Design | Adelaide</title>
<meta name="description" content="EDLC — Excavation & Design Co, Adelaide: earthworks, excavation, exposed concrete and exterior design. Specialising in cut & fill, site levelling, exposed aggregate and outdoor living design.">
<meta property="og:title" content="EDLC — Excavation & Design Co">
<meta property="og:description" content="Earthworks, exposed concrete & exterior design — Adelaide.">
<meta property="og:type" content="website">
