<section id="services"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head"><span class="sec-idx">01</span><div><h2 class="sec-title">What we dig &amp; build.</h2><p class="lead">Earthworks first, design second — one crew that owns the ground you build on and the finish you look at.</p></div></div>
  <div class="svc-list"><div class="svc-row rv"><span class="svc-n">01</span><div class="svc-body"><h3>Earthworks &amp; excavation</h3><p>Cut and fill, site levelling, trenching and bulk excavation — graded to the plan.</p></div><span class="svc-arrow">&#8599;</span></div><div class="svc-row rv"><span class="svc-n">02</span><div class="svc-body"><h3>Exposed concrete</h3><p>Exposed aggregate and decorative concrete pours that hold their look.</p></div><span class="svc-arrow">&#8599;</span></div><div class="svc-row rv"><span class="svc-n">03</span><div class="svc-body"><h3>Exterior design</h3><p>Design and build of outdoor areas — driveways, paths and site layout.</p></div><span class="svc-arrow">&#8599;</span></div><div class="svc-row rv"><span class="svc-n">04</span><div class="svc-body"><h3>Retaining &amp; drainage</h3><p>Retaining walls and drainage falls that keep water where it belongs.</p></div><span class="svc-arrow">&#8599;</span></div></div>
</div></section>

<section class="band" id="process"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head"><span class="sec-idx">02</span><div><h2 class="sec-title">How a job runs.</h2></div></div>
  <div class="steps"><div class="step rv"><span class="step-n">01</span><div><h3>Site visit &amp; scope</h3><p>Access, levels and soil checked — the job defined before any machinery moves.</p></div></div><div class="step rv"><span class="step-n">02</span><div><h3>Firm quote</h3><p>Bulk, hours and finish priced in writing.</p></div></div><div class="step rv"><span class="step-n">03</span><div><h3>Excavate &amp; prepare</h3><p>Cut, fill, compact — a level, sound base for what comes next.</p></div></div><div class="step rv"><span class="step-n">04</span><div><h3>Finish &amp; clean up</h3><p>Final grade, finish surfaces, site left clean.</p></div></div></div>
</div></section>

<section id="faq"><div class="wrap faq-wrap">
  <div class="sec-head"><span class="sec-idx">03</span><div><h2 class="sec-title">Asked on every site.</h2></div></div>
  <details class="faq rv"><summary>Do you handle both earthworks and finishes?</summary><div class="a">Yes — excavation to exposed concrete, one crew, one point of contact.</div></details><details class="faq rv"><summary>Which areas do you cover?</summary><div class="a">Adelaide and surrounding areas.</div></details><details class="faq rv"><summary>How long does a job take?</summary><div class="a">Depends on volume and access — quoted with a realistic timeline before we start.</div></details><details class="faq rv"><summary>How do I get a price?</summary><div class="a">Send the site details through the quote form and we will come back with a firm price.</div></details>
</div></section>

