  <div class="trust-strip"><div class="tr-i rv d1"><div class="tr-t">&#10003;</div><div><b>Earthworks to finish</b><span>One crew, whole job</span></div></div><div class="tr-i rv d2"><div class="tr-t">&#10003;</div><div><b>Adelaide</b><span>Local crew</span></div></div><div class="tr-i rv d3"><div class="tr-t">&#10003;</div><div><b>Firm quotes</b><span>Written, no surprises</span></div></div><div class="tr-i rv d4"><div class="tr-t">&#10003;</div><div><b>Clean sites</b><span>Left tidy after</span></div></div></div>
