<section id="work"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head"><div class="sec-idx">05</div><div><h2 class="rv d1">Our work.</h2><p class="lead rv d2">Earthworks, exposed concrete and exterior design across Adelaide.</p></div></div>
</div>
